Test Case Type:
Barclays Customer Indicator – Pre 01-Aug-2026 Logic

Test Case Long Description:
Validate that prior to 01-Aug-2026 the Barclays Customer Indicator is derived correctly using the existing business rule based on Bank Score Eligible Indicator and Gen 16 Bank Risk Score.

Expected Results:
For records before 01-Aug-2026:

BANK_SCORE_ELIGIBLE_INDICATOR = 1
AND GEN_16_BANK_RISK_SCORE IS NOT NULL
→ BARCLAYS_CUSTOMER_INDICATOR = 'Y'

All other records
→ BARCLAYS_CUSTOMER_INDICATOR = 'N'

No incorrectly mapped records should be present.

Actual Results:
Pending execution.

